  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "constellation-tle-latest",
  "description": "Daily TLE snapshots for 18 satellite constellations (2,067 satellites) from CelesTrak. Covers GNSS, LEO broadband, GEO comms, and Earth observation fleets.",
